Change a saved reply between reply and reply-all while preserving its content

Usage: mxr drafts audience [OPTIONS] --expected-revision <EXPECTED_REVISION> <--all|--single> <DRAFT_ID>

Arguments:
  <DRAFT_ID>

Options:
      --all

      --single

      --expected-revision <EXPECTED_REVISION>

      --dry-run
          Preview the exact recipient selection without saving it
  -h, --help
          Print help
